{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39082","headline":"寄进士崔鲁范 · 郑准","name":"寄进士崔鲁范","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳才子旧交知，别後干戈积咏思。\n百战市朝千里梦，三年风月几篇诗。\n山高鴈断音书绝，谷背莺寒变化迟。\n会待路宁归得去，酒楼渔浦重相期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑准","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}